  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given</p><p>FM broadcast</p><p>Modulating frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi></math></p><p>Deviation ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>frequency</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>deviation</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>modulating</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>frequency</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mi>f</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Frequency deviation,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Bandwidth <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>440</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
